      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, that's very helpful for my protocol. To be thorough, what should I look out for specifically to ensure they aren't reaching a toxic level? If the patient mentions minor shortness of breath or a slight dry cough, would that be an immediate reason to halt the 100mg BID regimen entirely, or is it safer to just monitor them and continue the 5-day course unless the symptoms become severe?",
